\section{Discussion and Limitations}
\label{sec:limits}
\textbf{Threats.}
(i) Synthetic trace domain shift to live cellular/mmWave~\cite{meng2024mmwave}.
(ii) Oracle Genie incomparability --- never marketed as competitor.
(iii) Smoothness surrogate uses VMAF differences; subjective studies future.
\textbf{Mitigation roadmap:} diversify traces, stratified bootstrap CIs~\cite{kvalbein2014}, user studies~\cite{wu2024qoe}.

% =========================================
\section{Conclusion}
\label{sec:conclusion}
We repositioned adaptive streaming as \textbf{Lagrangian CMDP surrogate training} complemented by deterministic \textbf{runtime shields}.
Our evaluation shows shielded constrained policies collapsing mean rebuffering percentages to \(\sim 1\%\)-level regimes versus \(\sim 15\%\) for comparable unshielded constrained RL under identical traces, illustrating an explicit QoE-vs-safety trade space rather than asserting universal QoE dominance.
Future exploration: differentiable risk metrics (CVaR~\cite{rockafellar2000}), live chunked prediction uncertainty, calibrated shield thresholds from field telemetry.

